  "_comment": "Parent-company registry for infrastructure / tenant-platform / tracking domain identification. v1.1 (v1.5.1 scoring) added per-entry policy fields apex_floor + subdomain_inherits + site_category to lock down trust inheritance: by default an apex listed here does NOT receive the brand anchor floor and a subdomain under it does NOT inherit. Patterns use simple suffix matching ('cloudfront.net' matches 'foo.cloudfront.net'). category is the historical sub-tag (cdn, cloud_compute, ...). site_category is the new top-level shape (tenant_platform, infrastructure, tracking) that drives scoring policy. assuranceBasis on the response surfaces the basis to agents.",
